  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Would it be possible to auto hide your avatar if someone is actively streaming? Like if they hit streamer mode it will mute and hide your avatar, and when they shut that off you become visible again? Either that or a red dot next to a user name to show they are streaming, it's a bit of a consent issue as they are streaming and making money off of whatever content you might be creating. Some people might be fine with that, while others not, the choice still needs to be there.",
